      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "I was able to get this working by modifying `/gpu/bitnet_kernels/compile.sh`. I added -Xcompiler and removed -Xcudafe --diag_suppress=177 --compiler-options. Compiled with CUDA/12.5\n\ncompile.sh:\n`nvcc -std=c++17 -Xcompiler -fPIC -lineinfo --shared bitnet_kernels.cu -lcuda -gencode=arch=compute_80,code=compute_80 -o libbitnet.so`\n\n",
      "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:26:11Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/microsoft/BitNet/issues/304#issuecomment-2980823574",
