  "body": "Running all of the steps in the README for /gpu results in broken output. For every prompt it just repeats one word many times, as shown below. Is there any remedy to this?\n\nExample:\n```\n$ python3 ./generate.py ./checkpoints/ --interactive --chat_format\nloaded model in 64.60 seconds\ncompiled model in 2.95 seconds\nenter prompt: hello\n[[128000, 1502, 25, 220, 15339, 128009, 72803, 25, 220]]\n9 32\n> hello\nHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHelloHello\n```",
